  <description lang="en-GB" default="true">One of the renowned blades that was beloved by the famous military commander Uesugi Kenshin. Bestowed with the power of water. (Sheathed)\nAttacking Strength: ★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="ja-JP" default="false">かの有名な武将・上杉謙信の愛刀のひとつ。水属性を帯びている。（帯刀状態）\n攻撃力 ：★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="en-US" default="false">One of the renowned blades that was beloved by the famous military commander Uesugi Kenshin. Bestowed with the power of water. (Sheathed)\nAttacking Strength: ★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="en-SG" default="false">One of the renowned blades that was beloved by the famous military commander Uesugi Kenshin. Bestowed with the power of water. (Sheathed)\nAttacking Strength: ★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="fr-FR" default="false">L'une des lames légendaires prisée par le célèbre commandant militaire Uesugi Kenshin. Imprégnée du pouvoir de l'eau. (Au fourreau)\nPuissance d’attaque : ★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="es-ES" default="false">Una de las espadas legendarias apreciadas por el famoso comandante militar Uesugi Kenshin. Dotada del poder del agua. (Envainada)\nFuerza de ataque: ★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="it-IT" default="false">Una delle lame leggendarie amate dal celebre comandante militare Uesugi Kenshin. Infusa con il potere dell'acqua. (Nel fodero)\nPotenza d'attacco: ★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="de-DE" default="false">Eine der legendären Klingen, die vom berühmten Feldherrn Uesugi Kenshin geschätzt wurde. Mit der Kraft des Wassers versehen. (In Scheide)\nAngriffsstärke: ★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="zh-HK" default="false">傳說中的名刀之一，為著名武將上杉謙信所鍾愛。蘊含水之力。（收鞘）\n攻擊力：★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="zh-TW" default="false">傳說中的名刀之一，為著名武將上杉謙信所鍾愛。蘊含水之力。（收鞘）\n攻擊力：★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="ko-KR" default="false">유명한 무장 우에스기 켄신이 아꼈던 전설적인 명검 중 하나. 물의 힘이 깃들어 있다. (칼집 상태)\n공격력: ★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <maker lang="en-GB" default="true">Granzella Inc.</maker>
